---
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title={`Terms of Use — ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`The terms that apply to using ${SITE.name}, including what the ratings are and are not, and the limits of what we can be responsible for.`}
>
  <h1 class="text-[32px] sm:text-[38px]">Terms of use</h1>

  <Prose>
    <p class="mt-5 text-ink-300">Last updated: 8 September 2026</p>

    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} is an information and comparison site. It is not a gambling operator, holds no
      gaming licence, accepts no bets and processes no wagers. Everything here is published
      for information; none of it is advice about whether you should gamble or where.
    </p>

    <h2>Age and legality</h2>
    <p>
      You must be at least 18, and older where your jurisdiction requires it. Online gambling
      is restricted or prohibited in many places, and the legality of using any operator
      listed here is yours to determine before you do. A casino appearing on this site is not
      a statement that it is lawful for you to use.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      Ratings are aggregated from third-party platforms and each carries the date it was
      checked. Bonus terms, supported coins, licensing and withdrawal policies change without
      notice, and a figure that was right when we checked it may be wrong by the time you read
      it. Always confirm the current terms on the operator's own site before depositing.
      Report anything wrong to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party sites</h2>
    <p>
      Outbound links lead to operators we neither own nor control. We are not responsible for
      their content, their terms, their handling of your money or your data, or any dispute
      between you and them. Listing an operator is not an endorsement or a guarantee of
      anything about it.
    </p>

    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>
      This site is provided as is. To the extent the law allows, we accept no liability for
      losses arising from using it or from acting on anything published here — gambling losses
      very much included.
    </p>

    <h2>Content</h2>
    <p>
      The written material, scoring method and design on this site belong to {SITE.name}. Ratings
      are attributed to the platforms that published them and remain theirs. You are welcome
      to quote us with a link.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      These terms may change; the date above tracks the last revision.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
